{"3974990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cozy Chessu", "steam_appid": 3974990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosy Chessu is a narrative-driven game about nostalgia. Set in a quaint Japanese izakaya, players will play as Ryo Kogure, a salesman turned restaurant worker seeking respite from city life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Revive the Izakaya</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liven up the restaurant by chatting and playing chess against Ryo’s old friends! Attract new customers with each match you conquer, and redecorate the izakaya to make it your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/extras/1d346a637430b18a049f6d1f7def6f99.poster.avif?t=1787942255\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/extras/1d346a637430b18a049f6d1f7def6f99.webm?t=1787942255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/extras/1d346a637430b18a049f6d1f7def6f99.mp4?t=1787942255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/extras/94c8abd446de6b3ebfd85e3952214838.avif?t=1787942255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/extras_big/94c8abd446de6b3ebfd85e3952214838.webp?t=1787942255 width=1560 height=340 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to play chess with cards through puzzles! Checkmate your opponents in friendly and high-stakes games to collect their unique ability cards, and diversify your own deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/extras/8b7b97f30bafa4f898002bcc2c80e828.poster.avif?t=1787942255\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/extras/8b7b97f30bafa4f898002bcc2c80e828.webm?t=1787942255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/extras/8b7b97f30bafa4f898002bcc2c80e828.mp4?t=1787942255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Emotional Stake</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bear witness with Ryo to a past long gone, but still weighs on the identities of many. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/extras/eb4500b7f35a54c06960dd948020243b.poster.avif?t=1787942255\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/extras/eb4500b7f35a54c06960dd948020243b.webm?t=1787942255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/extras/eb4500b7f35a54c06960dd948020243b.mp4?t=1787942255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy Japanese Izakaya</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Chapters of the Story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Ability Cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial-like Chess Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich World of Characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Taste of the Voice Overs!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FULL-GAME FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Against the Community/Customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional Cards and Abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Tycoon Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deckbuilding </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play story influence</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosy Chessu is a narrative-driven game about nostalgia. Set in a quaint Japanese izakaya, players will play as Ryo Kogure, a salesman turned restaurant worker seeking respite from city life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Revive the Izakaya</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liven up the restaurant by chatting and playing chess against Ryo’s old friends! Attract new customers with each match you conquer, and redecorate the izakaya to make it your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/extras/1d346a637430b18a049f6d1f7def6f99.poster.avif?t=1787942255\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/extras/1d346a637430b18a049f6d1f7def6f99.webm?t=1787942255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/extras/1d346a637430b18a049f6d1f7def6f99.mp4?t=1787942255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/extras/94c8abd446de6b3ebfd85e3952214838.avif?t=1787942255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/extras_big/94c8abd446de6b3ebfd85e3952214838.webp?t=1787942255 width=1560 height=340 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to play chess with cards through puzzles! Checkmate your opponents in friendly and high-stakes games to collect their unique ability cards, and diversify your own deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/extras/8b7b97f30bafa4f898002bcc2c80e828.poster.avif?t=1787942255\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/extras/8b7b97f30bafa4f898002bcc2c80e828.webm?t=1787942255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/extras/8b7b97f30bafa4f898002bcc2c80e828.mp4?t=1787942255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Emotional Stake</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bear witness with Ryo to a past long gone, but still weighs on the identities of many. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/extras/eb4500b7f35a54c06960dd948020243b.poster.avif?t=1787942255\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/extras/eb4500b7f35a54c06960dd948020243b.webm?t=1787942255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/extras/eb4500b7f35a54c06960dd948020243b.mp4?t=1787942255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy Japanese Izakaya</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Chapters of the Story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Ability Cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial-like Chess Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich World of Characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Taste of the Voice Overs!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FULL-GAME FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Against the Community/Customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional Cards and Abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Tycoon Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deckbuilding </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play story influence</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Cozy Chessu is a narratively driven Chess-TCG hybrid. Play as Ryo, a former local who returns to his hometown to rekindle with the community through chess. Unlock new cards, discover new strategies, and make an effort to reconnect with the people of Enomura.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/1b1eec632ba6c034aed93245ef030e83099132d1/header.jpg?t=1787942255", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/b44f31f66c9f24224a26246554992289f1ee8d0d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787942255", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974990/b44f31f66c9f24224a26246554992289f1ee8d0d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787942255", "website": "https://cozychessu.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 2500K or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 or AMD RX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</